The fidelity-2 SMF outer-scale AND preset fade-tail study (2-P5, 2-I3, 0-W4)
elevation     : 30.0 deg      trials/case: 1000
seed          : 20260904      block size: 50      workers: 8
scenario      : downlink, 1550 nm, 500 km, 700 mm ground SMF, 100 mm space terminal
configs       : ref, rapid
L0 values [m] : inf, 25 m
cases         : 2 configs x 2 outer scales = 4 campaigns
mode          : RUN
method        : WITHIN a config, a MATCHED-SEED L0 pair (one grid, one plan, one seed; only the outer-scale filter changes).
              : ACROSS configs, a QUANTILE comparison (the grids, the pixels and the screen counts differ), NOT matched-seed.
correction    : NONE. Fidelity 2 applies no tip-tilt removal and no AO (backlog 2-AO); the SMF power is the raw atmosphere.
primary       : the SMF coupled-power fade and the POINT irradiance fade. The aperture index s2_P is a footnote (strongly averaged).

THE CONFIGURATIONS (each config has its OWN grid and screen plan)
  ref (standard preset): the well-resolved REFERENCE: the pinned standard 15-screen grid and plan (the 2-P5 deliverable).
    grid 1024 px, 3.514 m (3.43 mm px); 15 screens; r0_total 12.73 cm
    screen h [m] : 17123 14637 13198 12072 11049 10072 9012 7697 5650 3571 2339 1443 614 216 55
    Cn2 share    : 0.005 0.005 0.006 0.006 0.007 0.007 0.008 0.009 0.012 0.018 0.025 0.038 0.077 0.183 0.593
    subharmonic reach ~ 95 m (27 x the 3.5 m grid side; backlog 2-P5)

  rapid (rapid preset): the RAPID preset AS SHIPPED: its own coarser grid and 5-screen plan (the 2-I3 default candidate).
    grid 256 px, 2.638 m (10.31 mm px); 5 screens; r0_total 12.73 cm
    screen h [m] : 14844 11014 7224 2191 140
    Cn2 share    : 0.016 0.021 0.029 0.080 0.853
    subharmonic reach ~ 71 m (27 x the 2.6 m grid side; backlog 2-P5)

  NOTE: the rapid subharmonic reach (71 m) is SMALLER than the reference (95 m), so rapid holds a smaller effective outer scale (backlog 2-P5).


